Package: libmbe-neo-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libmbe-neo2 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: MBE vocoder library - development files
 mbelib-neo provides IMBE and AMBE vocoder primitives used by digital radio
 applications.
 .
 This package contains the headers, static library, pkg-config metadata and
 CMake package configuration.

